  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide 1000 schoolbags to schoolchildren in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As education is a vital factor for the children who are regarded as the future hope, BFD appeals for assistance to provide 1000 schoolbags, chair and desk, uniform and meals for schoolchildren in Amran governorate. We envision education as a means of empowering the city to overcome poverty, which is one of the sustainable development goals.</narrative>
  </description>
